  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-21T03:51:54.072Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Had a thought that it would be neat if we could control some of the settings/actions in VRchat.\n\nMy main request would be to be able to toggle settings and do actions through OSC like:\n\n\"Toggle Full Body\"\n\n\"Toggle FBT Locomotion Animation\"\n\n\"Toggle FBT Avatar Measurement Mode\"\n\n\"FBT Lock Mode (advances through them one by one)\"\n\n\"Sit/Stand\"\n\n\"Allow/Pause Interactions\"\n\n\"Enable/Disable Camera\"\n\n\"Enable/Disable Personal Mirror\"\n\n\"Respawn\"\n\n\"Go Home\"\n\nI know that most of these are relatively easy to access through menus already and are probably used seldom enough that adding them as actions that can be completed through isn't that useful, but I think having the option to control these settings without having to open the menu could open up some creative uses/custom control schemes.",
